# HARD.P0-11 — H10: delete DESIGN.md

DESIGN.md (312 lines, 20 KB) was a HashiCorp marketing design-system spec:
near-black canvas, per-product accent colors, pricing-card components, and
"do not ship a light-mode marketing page". Its first line was the truncated
word "verview". Nothing in the repo referenced it, and it embedded another
company's proprietary brand spec — a legal liability for an open-source repo.

Fix per hardening-doc H10: delete the file. If the project needs a design
doc, write one.

$ git rm DESIGN.md
delete mode 100644 DESIGN.md

$ git show --stat HEAD | tail -3
1 file changed, 312 deletions(-)
